			"versionNonce": 1475138470,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772631075217,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Physical Time (Wall Clock Time)\n\nPhysical time is the actual clock time\nshown on a machine (e.g., 10:30:01 AM).\n\nEach server maintains its own physical\nclock.\n\nTo synchronize clocks, systems use:\n\nNetwork Time Protocol (NTP)\nPrecision Time Protocol (PTP)",
			"rawText": "Physical Time (Wall Clock Time)\n\nPhysical time is the actual clock time shown on a machine (e.g., 10:30:01 AM).\n\nEach server maintains its own physical clock.\n\nTo synchronize clocks, systems use:\n\nNetwork Time Protocol (NTP)\nPrecision Time Protocol (PTP)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "VVn9ip96",
			"originalText": "Physical Time (Wall Clock Time)\n\nPhysical time is the actual clock time shown on a machine (e.g., 10:30:01 AM).\n\nEach server maintains its own physical clock.\n\nTo synchronize clocks, systems use:\n\nNetwork Time Protocol (NTP)\nPrecision Time Protocol (PTP)",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
