			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772631877782,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Logical Time (Event Ordering Time)\n\nLogical time does not measure real-world time.\n\nIt measures order of events.\n",
			"rawText": "Logical Time (Event Ordering Time)\n\nLogical time does not measure real-world time.\n\nIt measures order of events.\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "7cco078ev3qy9v4GBQ0r1",
			"originalText": "Logical Time (Event Ordering Time)\n\nLogical time does not measure real-world time.\n\nIt measures order of events.\n",
