			"updated": 1773380944404,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "User Name: Alex\n\nUser Send Request: Machine 1: Alicia: 10:00:05  \nUser Send Request: Machine 2: Alice: 09:59:58 - (it is 7 seconds behind.)\n\n\nDB HISTORY:\n\nid ,userId ,name   , time\n1  ,123    ,Alex   , 07:00:03\n2  ,123    ,Alicia , 10:00:05 - TIME ERROR\n3  ,123    ,Alice  , 09:59:58 - TIME ERROR \n\nSelect * from user_name_history where userId = 123 order by time desc limit 1;\n",
			"rawText": "User Name: Alex\n\nUser Send Request: Machine 1: Alicia: 10:00:05  \nUser Send Request: Machine 2: Alice: 09:59:58 - (it is 7 seconds behind.)\n\n\nDB HISTORY:\n\nid ,userId ,name   , time\n1  ,123    ,Alex   , 07:00:03\n2  ,123    ,Alicia , 10:00:05 - TIME ERROR\n3  ,123    ,Alice  , 09:59:58 - TIME ERROR \n\nSelect * from user_name_history where userId = 123 order by time desc limit 1;\n",
